%% TECH-029 Test suite time
%% How a feature's tests are kept cheap: look for an existing test first, and merge or remove before a limit is touched.
flowchart TD
    A[Feature needs a browser test] --> B{A rule?}
    B -- yes --> C[Unit test for the cases, one browser test to show it - TECH-029-R3]
    B -- no --> D{A test already opens this page in this state?}
    D -- yes --> E[Add the check to it, name the requirement]
    D -- no --> F[New test with shared set-up]
    C --> G[npm run test:time]
    E --> G
    F --> G
    G --> H{Over the budget?}
    H -- no --> I[Record the seconds added in verification.md]
    H -- yes --> J[Merge or remove tests first, never raise a limit in the same pull request]
    J --> G
